6. Runtime/API Contract
Known/Available Endpoints
Based on repository structure (to be verified by local agent):
- /api/simulation/status — current simulation state
- /api/npc/list — NPC catalog with memory/goal summaries
- /api/factions/status — faction power balance
- /api/timeline/day/:n — historical snapshot by day
- /api/constitution — governance rules reference
Speculative Future Endpoints
- /api/world-state — aggregated world metrics
- /api/cascade/:chain_id — specific event cascades
- /api/export/day/:n — data export for analysis
- /api/events/live — WebSocket for real-time updates
Endpoints Requiring Auth/Rate Limiting
- /api/admin/stop — simulation control (admin only)
- /api/admin/reset — hard reset (admin only)
- /api/npc/create — NPC generation (admin only)
- Any write endpoints — never from public frontend without auth
